# Frame — .gitignore
#
# Two rules from CLAUDE.md shape this file:
#   - Context docs are committed. There is deliberately NO blanket *.md ignore.
#   - `.claude/` is gitignored.
# The eval dataset is version-controlled (ADR-0004) and is deliberately NOT ignored.

# ---------- Secrets ----------
# Never relax these. The extension bundle is public (threat-model.md §5); anything
# that leaks here is public the moment the repo flips.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
secrets/
.secrets/
service-account*.json
gcp-*.json

# Chrome extension signing key. The public `key` in manifest.json is fine to commit;
# the .pem that generates it is not. Covered by *.pem above, named here so nobody
# "fixes" the glob without understanding it.
key.pem
*.crx

# ---------- Agent / editor local state ----------
.claude/
.cursor/
.aider*
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo

# ---------- Node / TypeScript / Vite ----------
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.vite/
*.tsbuildinfo
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
.eslintcache
# Lockfiles are committed on purpose. Do not add them here.

# ---------- Next.js ----------
.next/
out/

# ---------- Python / FastAPI ----------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.venv/
venv/
env/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.tox/
.coverage
.coverage.*
coverage.xml
htmlcov/
coverage/

# ---------- Hosting / tooling ----------
.vercel/
.turbo/

# ---------- Local scratch ----------
*.log
logs/
tmp/
scratch/
.local/

# ---------- Local-only assets ----------
# Concept mockups. Kept out of the public repo: they show evidence that is not in the
# selected text and a position needle (Q1 is open) — the opposite of what Frame promises.
Claude outputs/

# ---------- OS ----------
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
